# Connections to other knowledge agents
error-kq-already-connected = This workspace is already connected to that knowledge agent.
error-kq-config-invalid = The connection to other knowledge agents isn't set up correctly, so it couldn't start.
error-kq-connection-not-found = This workspace has no such connection.
error-kq-not-a-knowledge-agent = That address doesn't belong to a knowledge agent.
error-kq-not-supported = That kind of connection isn't available in this mode.
error-kq-no-connections = This workspace isn't connected to any other knowledge agents, so only its own pages were searched.
error-kq-other-company = That knowledge agent signs people in through a different company, so it can't be used.
error-kq-sign-in-needed = Sign in again to reach that knowledge agent.
error-kq-store-unavailable = Your knowledge connections couldn't be saved or read. Try again in a moment.
error-kq-too-many-connections = This workspace already has 8 connections. Remove one before adding another.
error-kq-unknown-proxy = The question named a helper that isn't set up, so it wasn't asked.
error-kq-unreachable = That knowledge agent can't be reached right now. Try again in a moment.
error-kq-url-invalid = That isn't a valid address. Use a secure address of 2,048 characters or fewer, without a name or section after it.
